{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_01_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:74546ea469cc6d78e0a11f0876ba93efed024cb0714c12b98a9e30c0c4c7d4bd",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0ef8f1e31c8467728b4c8fa74211a3d722659cd5a36daacc78cd44c94b9b54f3",
      "text": "秀的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5324b171b9f764f43a29e6878a311a517981dc1ab9df8717e8f9c7657555233",
      "text": "怎么样？完成度挺高的吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9d9c2d2991ccda01132ddd15f3a327260b19f4ba0211fc3c10c8cff0466b9424",
      "text": "我参考了你的建议。\n托你的福变成一首好歌了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eed0ae2d5e5a6d50c15762813e5180205aefda77c5837b149b15eda7ec9c5609",
      "text": "来，你看看。\n评论区已经被感想给淹没了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f84816dd918e34494dc988e4ac1688eddfbbf6252696cc2d06d11015846d23b6",
      "text": "“果然是天才！”“超出了预期”吗。\n简直是一片赞赏的狂潮啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5e11d9aa04284f3a97087db8022ad09630f1c1fb1e3bb6b4ab3e48f744baf504",
      "text": "嘛，毕竟是我的歌，\n受到好评也是理所当然的啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6b860a22c51510fa9ab4216ede632f54405dd3cd67bb0dc0fc977d276252a7ad",
      "text": "也是，真不愧是秀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:24d07361a8cac5d6f1100af6174a75a6ff6aa5088c399bae8ff0232ef8e2c547",
      "text": "下次活动，是要把之前的歌打包一起出吧？\n感觉又会很热闹了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ce3463996cc34bb3d145926637117008ff5415d2794b964429043a48391873a3",
      "text": "啊，好好期待吧。\n你也要来帮我摆摊卖唱片哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c00ebe05cb715d2839fe9f66e7dccaff146e095068f0106ec640d11274c7891a",
      "text": "（……跟这家伙待在一起很开心）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad312a940905f15aefbe2a69e8bc545eab50fd99a8f30e2d70f7d96f5ccdb228",
      "text": "（只要两个人一起，用音乐，\n连世界肯定都能改变）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_01_1_1_016_01:1_1_016_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:526e7222f07f59c4a7bb677ab13dfd54e507970040f0851aba64c91ea95ce949",
      "text": "（说起来……我开始做音乐，\n也是因为这家伙才开始的来着）",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
